    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3e/Seeria_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260516221006\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Seeria Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"827\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Seeria Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Seeria_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3e/Seeria_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260516221006\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>命运引导者</b>\n</p><p>一位旅行占卜师，寻找强壮、美丽的战士来战斗。\n她能看见未来，并正在寻找一位能抵抗命运的战士，以防止她在童年时看到的「末日未来」。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"46690fafde230e9d168a417ce45e9e34\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Seeria_Guide_of_Destiny_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:81px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Seeria_Guide_of_Destiny_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Seeria Guide of Destiny Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (370 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:81px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dd/Seeria_Guide_of_Destiny_Queen%27s_Blade_Un